{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"基本保留了v6中想到对方就柔软、格外想亲近的心理事实，没有新增人物身份或具体情境。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“他知道自己想说什么，也怕一说出口两人的关系就会变”把B2中的假设性倾诉处境写成了他真实的打算，“只敢刚迈近一步”又把B3踏上船板的比喻转成了现实的关系动作。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"保留了v6中喜欢看似轻却舍不得放下的矛盾，“才刚冒出来”是对当下情感状态的概括，没有把烟花写成真实事件，也没有明确把音乐变化当作心理原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线就能看出他想到某人会柔软并想靠近，因担心关系变化而迟疑，最后又舍不得放下这份看似轻微的喜欢。 \",\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R3\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"“眼下还没有非作决定不可的事”这一独立情境判断没有保留，也没有被其他说法取代；“说不清自己为何这样谨慎”与B2已经给出的谨慎缘由不合，删掉不算丢。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S01-2\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“只敢刚迈近一步，还没安稳下来”把迟疑与未安定连续写了两遍，后半又像是为对应B3而硬加的意象化表达，没有提供新的心理原因。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3d94a0f3-02d2-4abc-b4a7-1960e4f70511", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T083724696762Z", "elapsed_seconds": 448.313, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T08:44:53.008697+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0cdabefca2f4eb8728d3079f36d742de3cfa322106d0c24837f266ea6d0a00a3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7